<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Composition with Red, Blue and Yellow (1930) · Piet Mondrian and De Stijl</title>
<meta name="description" content="The story of Piet Mondrian's Composition with Red, Blue and Yellow (1930): the painter, the year, De Stijl and its principles, and why the work still matters.">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Archivo+Black&family=Space+Grotesk:wght@400;500;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root{
    --red:#dd0100;
    --blue:#225095;
    --yellow:#fac901;
    --ink:#111111;
    --paper:#ffffff;
    --lw:clamp(6px, 0.85vw, 10px);
    --shadow:8px 8px 0 var(--ink);
    --pad:clamp(20px, 5vw, 64px);
  }

  *{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box;}

  html{scroll-behavior:smooth;}

  body{
    font-family:'Space Grotesk', Arial, sans-serif;
    font-size:17px;
    line-height:1.6;
    color:var(--ink);
    background:var(--paper);
  }

  section[id]{scroll-margin-top:96px;}

  h1,h2,h3{font-family:'Archivo Black', 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;line-height:1.04;text-transform:uppercase;}

  a{color:inherit;}

  :focus-visible{outline:4px solid var(--blue);outline-offset:3px;}

  ::selection{background:var(--yellow);color:var(--ink);}

  /* ---------- Navigation ---------- */
  .nav{
    position:sticky;top:0;z-index:20;
    display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;
    padding:14px clamp(16px,4vw,44px);
    background:var(--paper);
    border-bottom:var(--lw) solid var(--ink);
  }
  .brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-size:14px;}
  .brand .logo{width:20px;height:20px;background:var(--red);border:3px solid var(--ink);flex:none;}
  .nav-links{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:26px;list-style:none;}
  .nav-links a{
    text-decoration:none;font-weight:700;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;
    padding-bottom:3px;border-bottom:4px solid transparent;
  }
  .nav-links a:hover{border-bottom-color:var(--red);}
  .nav-cta{
    background:var(--yellow);border:3px solid var(--ink);text-decoration:none;
    font-weight:700;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;
    padding:9px 16px;box-shadow:4px 4px 0 var(--ink);
    transition:transform .15s ease, box-shadow .15s ease;
  }
  .nav-cta:hover{transform:translate(-2px,-2px);box-shadow:6px 6px 0 var(--ink);}

  /* ---------- Hero ---------- */
  .hero{
    display:grid;gap:var(--lw);padding:var(--lw);
    background:var(--ink);
    grid-template-columns:1.1fr .95fr 1.15fr;
    grid-template-rows:auto auto;
    grid-template-areas:
      "title title paint"
      "intro meta  paint";
  }
  .h-title{grid-area:title;background:var(--red);color:#fff;padding:clamp(30px,4.5vw,66px);}
  .h-intro{grid-area:intro;background:var(--paper);padding:clamp(26px,3vw,46px);}
  .h-meta{grid-area:meta;background:var(--blue);color:#fff;padding:clamp(26px,3vw,46px);}
  .h-paint{grid-area:paint;background:var(--paper);display:grid;place-items:center;padding:clamp(22px,3vw,48px);}

  .kicker{
    display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;
    font-weight:700;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;
  }
  .kicker .chip{width:13px;height:13px;border:2px solid currentColor;flex:none;}

  .h-title h1{font-size:clamp(34px,4.8vw,66px);margin:18px 0 20px;max-width:14ch;}
  .h-title .sub{font-size:15px;letter-spacing:.05em;opacity:.92;}

  .h-intro p{max-width:46ch;}

  .h-meta dl{display:grid;grid-template-columns:auto 1fr;gap:8px 18px;margin-top:16px;font-size:14px;}
  .h-meta dt{font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;font-size:11px;opacity:.85;padding-top:2px;}
  .h-meta dd{font-weight:500;}

